# Anchored with a leading slash: these name the Python engine and the agent
# config at the REPO ROOT. Unanchored, they match at any depth, which silently
# excluded web/src/app/signals/ and web/src/components/signals/ from the
# upload and failed the build with "Can't resolve @/components/signals/...".
/signals/
/.claude/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/venv
web/node_modules
web/.next
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
